            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 3,
              "heading": "CloudWay 24 Dangerous Goods Policy"
            },
            "text": "As per international aviation safety regulations and CloudWay 24's commitment to passenger safety, certain items are classified as Dangerous Goods and are strictly regulated. Please review the following policy to ensure compliance and avoid inconvenience during travel."
          }
        ],
        "sections": [
          {
